OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn 'Britannia Shield'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Finvest #10bn in a new missile and drone
OL,8,Fdefence system to defend the UK if
OL,9,Fvoted into government at the next
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe so-called "Britannia Shield" would
OL,13,Fprovide an integrated network of radar,
OL,14,Fcommand and control systems, as well as
OL,15,Finterceptor missiles, the party said.
OL,17,FIn a speech at the Conservative Party
OL,18,Fconference on Tuesday, shadow defence
OL,19,Fsecretary James Cartlidge will describe
OL,20,Fthe pledge as "the most significant
OL,21,Fupgrade to UK air defence for
OL,22,Fgenerations".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
