OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn 'Britannia Shield'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, Defence Secretary Wes
OL,7,FStreeting said the Tories had an
OL,8,F"abysmal record" of defending Britain
OL,9,Fduring their 14 years in power, adding:
OL,10,F"They owe Britain an apology, not
OL,11,Fanother lecture."
